         - Suggest identification workflow based on Gram (GPC vs GNB).
         - IF GRAM NEGATIVE BACILLI (GNB): Based on colony morphology (e.g. Lactose fermentation, Swarming, Smell, Pigment), PREDICT the expected biochemical profile for the likely organism.
